"</blockquote>\n        <cite><strong>Priya S.</strong>Parent of a Kids Foundations graduate</cite>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"review\">\n        <div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div>\n        <blockquote>\"I hadn't been on a board since high school. Jules got me rolling confidently in one session and I still come back for open skate.\"</blockquote>\n        <cite><strong>Marcus T.</strong>Adult learner</cite>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"review\">\n        <div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div>\n        <blockquote>\"Honest staff who won't upsell you a $300 deck when a $70 one will do. The complete board they built me still rides perfectly after a year.\"</blockquote>\n        <cite><strong>Early R.</strong>Shop regular</cite>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ VISIT ============ -->\n<section id=\"visit\" style=\"padding-top:20px\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"hours\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Visit the shop</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:2.6rem\">412 Ferris Ave<br>Unit 2, Riverside</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Free street parking out front. Bike racks at the side door. Ring the bell after hours for a lesson check-in.</p>\n      <dl>\n        <dt>Monday \u2013 Friday</dt><dd>11 AM \u2013 8 PM</dd>\n        <dt>Saturday</dt><dd>10 AM \u2013 7 PM</dd>\n        <dt>Sunday</dt><dd>10 AM \u2013 5 PM</dd>\n        <dt>Phone</dt><dd>(555) 014-2290</dd>\n        <dt>Email</dt><dd>hello@lowlineskate.co</dd>\n      </dl>\n      <p class=\"note\">Lessons run rain or shine. Indoor backup space available for kids' classes during bad weather.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"map\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Map showing Lowline Skate Co. location on Ferris Avenue\">\n      <div class=\"pin\">Lowline HQ</div>\n      <div class=\"street\">Ferris Ave</div>\n    </div>\n  </d